      "content": "i know people say that but it doesnt change the reality of it. if i wasnt here, my mom wouldnt have to worry about me constantly, and my friends wouldn't have to deal with my drama. its like, wouldnt it be more compassionate of me to just stop being a problem? to just... step out of the way so they can finally have some peace? it feels like the only way to actually fix the damage i've caused.",
